    "en": {
      "trackName": "Block Nova - Watch Games",
      "description": "Block Nova is a block puzzle game designed for Apple Watch.\n\nDrag different shapes onto the board, fill rows or columns, and clear them to score. It is quick to play, easy to learn, and perfect for short breaks.\n\nFeatures:\n- Optimized for Apple Watch\n- Many block shapes to challenge your spatial thinking\n- High score tracking and quick restarts\n- Free trials, with unlimited play in the full version\n- Unlock more block color themes\n\nNo complicated controls. Just raise your wrist and start a round.",
      "releaseNotes": "Improved localization display.",
